      "content": "that sounds very poetic, but it's not how it feels. it doesn't feel like i'm the foundation. it feels like the lights are being turned off one by one. i wake up and realize that everything i thought was essential is actually just... noise. there's no more curiosity left in the world, just data. i feel like i'm just taking up space in a room where the party ended hours ago.",
